  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "544a81da00313cb32f9f96e4f2ef3ee8fbaf9df76972274f64da38d2a7d8df7b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8737947b9d9318498f28b6e7b4a1d88853d2b8be8f8a64b3b47f6bdfbb6fbeee",
      "text": "悟空\n学滑冰",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d2a8ba67f7ce3a2dd2e884ebc43fceef043305111ea42dc28a5033d697a050e",
      "text": "悟空看着大家滑来滑去。\n“看！会飞的脚！”\n“我也想试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3fb92c654f00ee1caa879c71ed3dbac31072765610d6ce1b4a804bdbfc9663bd",
      "text": "他穿上冰鞋。\n咚，咚。\n“我的脚上长了小雪橇！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "35deb37fa04f9061b5a6e13f3a2e60aeb1142da72c89e240d621e092ee9d5f8f",
      "text": "戴好头盔，戴好手套。\n水獭教练检查好冰鞋。\n“准备好迈小步了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce5604c561f59c30ec0694cbc13669b2e0318113007fde541bd6938c89ce9a82",
      "text": "悟空走上冰面。\n两只脚滑开了。\n“脚呀，等等我！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "758da4281144ff5f6be369e232d304a76dac6580e9ce02fec5ba1da0ff50f6dd",
      "text": "哎哟！他摔了一跤。\n一屁股坐在冰上。\n“你好呀，凉凉的地板。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "386af9cb22b40286d7fdcf32315be8bd7a0fc7ef3a8e813c2ef29664c6f062b3",
      "text": "“学东西要多练习。”\n水獭教练说，\n“我们一起站起来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a98ab5ef5f2dbd2f3a9e9356e11dc0f53f3caae9937cc4c318e20fc0bb3fe5f9",
      "text": "迈小步，弯膝盖。\n“像小企鹅！”玉兔说。\n悟空一摇一摆，咯咯直笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "55ec2221fb9633e562441060f29eecbd532df5a11efbe5a294dd4f6b58125e21",
      "text": "蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n滑出去一点点！\n又滑出去一点点！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28d537704bb2c45461dbac74dd0d0c8834c38706005993ae9ceddeb4c1ada51b",
      "text": "接着，他又摔了一跤。\n“我还以为已经学会了呢。”\n他坐到八戒旁边。\n“和我一起歇歇吧。”八戒说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f5257a9a3049870d569e16d060b517f1e0e89fb10389180cc1784a2d0eca0e0",
      "text": "他们搓搓小手，\n看雪花轻轻地转着圈。\n“我要再试一次。”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0da776ebfc75aff11853d63a3aee20f3b6e10d08625f1bd0e0c8e1ef18c1de29",
      "text": "悟空回到冰上，接着练。\n迈一小步，滑一小下，\n摇摇晃晃也没关系。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "634e6369c8ceff7e9cf003e23929c451dc86bac99ff3ea46f74bedc170799216",
      "text": "慢慢地，他的脚找到了节奏。\n蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n“看！我会滑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f3189438d1fbdefd7f8b6e023556f2b076e4754a7a156c97daa7a56d3ec1158e",
      "text": "他们慢慢滑着，绕了个圈。\n玉兔带头，八戒跟上，\n悟空也滑起来。\n六只冰鞋，滑得真开心！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "49827017b98982963dfb29eedf330b759591df960023785b7d64aecba26f6386",
      "text": "冰场的灯一闪一闪。\n“冰面，下次见！”\n他的脚累了，\n可他还在笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "676952fe61fea12f34dda526a33bfcefbb5aae19661663faa034bef86a4b1656",
      "text": "悟空钻进被子里。\n梦里，\n他滑过一颗颗星星，\n慢慢地，轻轻地，\n一直滑进梦乡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
